title: $:/plugins/nikorion/base-fields/search-filters
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
project-search-filter: [all[tiddlers]!has[draft.of]has[project]get[project]sort[]search:title<userInput>]
tools-search-filter: [all[tiddlers]!has[draft.of]has[tools]get[tools]enlist-input[]sort[]search:title<userInput>]

Completion filters for the `project` and `tools` inputs: each lists the values already used in that field elsewhere in the wiki, narrowed by what has been typed.

They live on fields rather than inline because `keyboard-driven-input` reads them from a tiddler, named by its `configTiddlerFilter` parameter and the field named by `firstSearchFilterField`.
